..... I realize that I am slower than a lot of people to learn things with computer programs. But I also notice that no one in our group, if they do know how to do something, has ever found it easy to explain how to do it to others.
...... And there are some very basic things that NO ONE in my 30 member group can figure out. How do we create a new room within our channel? Shouldn’t this be as simple as adding a new folder in a file system? We’ve been using Discord over 3 years, yet no current member can figure out how to do this.
.....  In terms of ease of use, Discord is a mess. I have to deduct 2 stars for that reason alone. I would give 5 stars if things were reasonably easy to learn.",3,37.0,Dhsgshahjdbs,1
us,United States,8496410523,2022-03-25T22:43:33-07:00,Bad customer support,"I have had discord for 5+ years now and throughout those years I have joined a lot of servers and made a lot of online friends. It was a great way to enjoy gaming with other people that liked what I liked. However this year, March 4th 2022, my account was disabled with no warning or anything, just a email informing me. The email contained what “I had done” but never provides proof or evidence, because I have never posted or joined a server for revenge p***. Regardless I tried getting to customer support and OH BOY WAS THAT BAD. Instead of contacting you with someone, ie a HUMAN, they use bots for everything, including for disabling accounts. I get it’s a easy system to target accounts who violate the TOS and other bots/scammers and it would be hard to handle millions of users, but when people have given time and money to the platform for years you’d think they would review it personally or give a warning. Remember I DIDNT ANYTHING THEY CLAIMED IN THE EMAIL. Anyways after trying to appeal and getting denied by a bot, “shocker”, I gave up cause they don’t care about their individual consumers. I wish they had taken time to contact me and we can sort this out but unfortunately that will never happen. 

Also they “claim” after being disabled for 2 weeks your account will be deleted. But the few people I was able to keep in contact with say they can still see my account. I am also still being charged for nitro so if they could stop that or give me my account back I’d appreciate it. 

