us,United States,11406861319,2024-06-21T08:07:18-07:00,Monopoly Go,"I absolutely Love Monopoly Go!! Was a fannof the board game as a child, playing on weekends with family. We would stay up all night long if needed, until there was one winner take all. I do have some gripes about the politics in the game, such as we get notifications of new tournaments, & who bankrupted us, however, why aren't we notified a couple days ahead of schedule, for when a New Album is going to start, & the old one is deleted? Many of us had 1 card left in order to win 15,000 dice, & in the middle of purchasing a pack of dice/wild cards, & then poof, right in middle of purchase, The screen turned black, & a New game starts, leaving us angry that we could of won, if we had a notification that we had 1 day or 2 hour? Especially those of us that spend hundreds, to play, & yet end up getting burned? That is a MUST to let players know they have a limited amount of time to finish! Thats my worst gripe about the politics. Thanks for listening, & I pray you actually HEAR me. Respectfully, Silvermoonbeam65",5,234.0,SylverStarduster,1
