us,United States,12417361567,2025-03-13T17:12:27-07:00,Infinite ban for no reason,I keep getting banned again and again for no reason like it keeps saying ban evasion like I didn’t do anything before I got in trouble cause I was in a server I didn’t know about and guess what they banned my account for it like they remove a server from your list making you maybe forgot about the server they find an issue with it they give you a violation that’s what they did but guess what they brought it right back after saying the server was alright and the violation was lifted then once again gave me another violation for the server and it got me banned for apparently child endangered I’m like hello your banning someone who is a legal minor and telling me I’m endangering myself like what it’s just dumb I’m trying to play games with friends on my pc and stuff but guess what I can’t now cause of this it’s not fair like if ya get banned what they should do is not just keep your accounts out of it all just give them the rights to add people and get inv to servers that’s all or at least have permission from discord to join these servers all I want is all of my info back and just a way to enjoy time with my friends and be able to use it for school,1,270.0,bov💁,1
us,United States,6367854717,2020-08-27T14:02:19-07:00,The Best Messaging Platform,"To me, Discord is the best way to chat with friends, family, and strangers alike. It has an amazing and simple UI, and it works well on all my devices. The moderation side of things is well-thought out too. I own a server with my friends to talk on while gaming, and it is easy to add new roles for people. The bots in discord are good as well, because you can use them to play music, look things up, and more. Also, discord is a good way to chat with strangers and meet new people, without giving out your phone number. And as a final touch, discord’s sense of humor is great. It feels like there are no Easter eggs or humor in any software/apps these days, but discord is different: it has a friendly interface, with many features implemented that are funny. Overall, discord is an amazing chat platform. 

One more thing though: I’ve noticed I can’t paste anything into discord on mobile... it could be my phone though, since the storage is always full.",5,36.0,🏳️‍🌈Zhärlas🏳️‍🌈,0
us,United States,9446558908,2022-12-28T22:49:04-07:00,Password complaint,I think that if I want to change my password I should be allowed to have a “forgot password” button because I’m a very forgetful person and if I wanna use my password for something I can’t if I don’t even remember it and when I go to change it I HAVE to use my current password and how am I supposed to do that if I don’t remember my password? There are multiple things I’ve wanted to do on discord but I can’t due to the fact I don’t remember my password and yes some of you reading so you should know if you should download the app or not may say “oh well then why don’t you write down your password?” I didn’t think of it at the time so always right down you’re password so that if you need it one day you have it right there for you but please discord give a forgot password button because I can’t remember my password and on behalf of all of us who are forgetful it is super annoying knowing I can’t change my password if I have to use my current one. Thank you that is all,4,158.0,aphmau 123,0
us,United States,8456224093,2022-03-14T16:12:08-07:00,Not receiving nitro after paying?,"I’ve been having an issue regarding the subscription for nitro. I’ve tried 2-3 times , subscribing for original nitro , but it does not however give me the perks it’s supposed too. After paying nothing had changed and I haven’t received the perks , not even a notification to show that I had got it. I tried different payment methods and even tried different devices , paying with my apple funds on my mobile device , and paying with a visa card via pc. Even when it came to using a computer discord always crashed when I put my card info. I wasted 20-30 dollars with no refund trying to buy it. However it does say i have a subscription but through the actual app it doesn’t say I own nitro. I am thoroughly disappointed and upset with this , and hope to get it fixed. Gifting nitro seems to work just fine , but why can’t I get it myself? Note , I have tried updating the app , reinstalling , waiting a few days , and nothing changed. Please help!",4,117.1,montbear1,0
us,United States,6979310616,2021-02-10T16:21:35-07:00,Poor Interface with Apple Devices,"We just switched to Discord from Slack at my job and I cannot express in words how frustrating of a process this has been. Registering for Discord was a NIGHTMARE. The first invitation link I received was expired despite opening it within minutes of receiving it. It took 3 tries to even get one that wasn’t expired. After I finally got in to set it up, it wouldn’t take my birthday. I would enter it and it would disappear after the menu collapsed. After a few days of trying to figure it out, I got in. After that, I tried sharing a photo that I took on my iPhone (HEIC file) but it doesn’t just show the photo like Slack, Twitter, Facebook, or literally any other site like this would. It posts it as a file and when you click on the file in Discord, it opens a web browser (Chrome, Safari, etc.) and forced downloads the file to your device, all before you even have a chance to view it. This is insanely inefficient, especially for a job that relies on the sharing of photographs. Additionally, it shows that Discord as a software is too weak to handle everything that most softwares can handle on their own. Step it up Discord.",2,60.0,Flffkshahdd,3
us,United States,6918069933,2021-01-26T20:23:14-07:00,In app purchase,"So I’ve had this app for years and I used to not use it until close to the end of 2020. Now the issue is not the function or anything for me, it’s the fact that I’ve been trying to send I long video to my friend cause it’s his birthday where he is from, so I made a video for him that it over a minute long. Now the app is telling me to get this boost thing and when I click for more info, I get taken to where there are payments. I’ve clicked two versions, one for 9.99 and one for 4.99 and both have said that there was an error. Now I don’t know what error that would be but please the creators of this app, if you say there’s in app purchases available; please make sure the users are able to make a purchase or better explain what we need to do to make that purchase. I like the app and I like that I’m able to someone who is from a different country but I hate that I can’t send a video to him that took me two hours to make. That might not seem like a lot of time but it was for me. So please if someone can contact t me about this, that would be lovely. Have a lovely day/night.",3,58.0,By Natalia27,2
us,United States,8934730861,2022-08-01T10:50:15-07:00,I love discord,"Discord saved me. I was in a very toxic household and was homeschooled so I rarely got to socialize or talk to my friends because my phone was regularly checked. I wasn’t allowed to have discord but a friend convinced me to sneak it on my phone to play among us in their server. I downloaded it January 2021 and played with them. And ended up joining a server through instagram and making a lot of online friends and joining even more servers over the year. I was able to vent to my friends about ny mother without the risk of her finding it. The beginning of the 2021 school year i cut my hair after my mom told me not to and she took my phone and inevitably went through it and found discord. After reading my messages about her things fell out between us and I ended up moving in with my dad. My life is much better because i made the decision to download discord. Thank you for helping me socialize in those dark times, without discord I wouldn’t have made it.",5,137.0,Kenriquez04,0
us,United States,10675138533,2023-12-09T09:04:17-07:00,New UI - Unintuitive and Inaccessible,"Opening up discord today I see “An improved mobile experience has arrived!” and I think to myself “Okay cool, a new update!” and swipe up to see what has changed. First thing I notice is the new colors for dark mode, I don’t like it, but I assume I can change it back in a bit. While looking around at all the new changes, which I will discuss soon, I begin to develop a headache. This is due to my astigmatism, the drastic contrast of white text on the almost black background creates a vividly bright blooming affect that strains my eyes whenever looking at the screen. I quickly go to settings to change this eyesore and notice there is no option to switch back! I try light mode, but that isn’t much better. Every time I get on the app now I am left with a headache, and I cannot imagine what it’s like for people with worse conditions. Another issue I have is the inability to simply swipe and see server lists. I now have to use my other hand and tap the channel name, which is much more inconvenient and unintuitive than before. Technology is supposed to be designed for convenience, and this change is less convenient and inaccessible for people who say only have one hand or those who are using their other one for something else. There was no reason for a lot of these UI changes! I feel like they were made to appease investors who want to see growth on the platform, but Discord is very niche, you aren’t going to see older people join when they have other apps like Facebook. You need to appease your already strong user base, and these changes have a lot of us enraged. They say growth for the sake of growth is the philosophy of a cancer cell. Keep that in mind when you make useless changes to “grow” your user base, this will put you behind in the long run.",1,207,FatCatFish659,0
us,United States,10665561277,2023-12-06T20:27:34-07:00,If its not broken don’t fix it.,"I understand the discord wants to update its app but quite honestly this is not the way to do it. The past couple updates where they try to force the new UI down your throat is highly annoying and now they are forcing you to use it. Ive tried several ways of going back to the original and now worked, its not even an option in my settings anymore. I have used discord for nearly 4 years now and it has worked perfectly fin and well as is. Now it feels like it just wants to be another social media platform that it isn't meant to be. Discord was easy and understandable before but the new ui is confusing and overwhelming to look at not to mention i get lost almost any time i use it. Please if you are going to shove this new UI down our throats at least give us who prefer the old one an option to keep it that way. Also i don't know anyone who was pushing for a new UI and it is horrid that an app and company who wants to bring people together isn't listening to their users. Please actually read your feed back and don't fix something if it isn't broken.",2,207,jokeytoki on aj amino,0
us,United States,9316599597,2022-11-22T04:49:27-07:00,Appeal System,"The appeal system is absolutely trash. I get it that you have probably hundreds of thousands of requests that you need to get through. But when you’re helping someone can you put some effort in it? I’ve emailed your support system TWICE with the same response each submission. Word for word, exactly the same. When I do reply and ask kindly on what I can do to get my account back, no response and just disappeared forever. They didn’t even bother to try and help me except to go back to the previous email to find what I did wrong which is a bot. Why would I need a bot when I need an actual person to help me and realize what I did wasn’t my fault? All I’m saying here is when you’re trying to help a user, or when you get to them, try your best to help them instead of copy and pasting your response just to get over them. My account was falsly disabled for something I didn’t do and no one bothered to even know my situation or even go into the details of what happened, instead, just copy and pasted your previous response. I’ve been using this app for years and made tons of memories yet I have never been more disappointed in a support system like this.",1,154.0,Sarahdepotato,0
us,United States,4366310611,2019-06-24T22:16:28-07:00,Good,"I think this to be a pretty cool application considering it’s a free to use messaging and calling service, which also lets you create your own servers for your own gaming communities/other things that may need discussion. One of the more recent updates, however, made it so when someone called you through the app, it would act as a phone call on your phone. This is an issue with maybe privacy, but also while you’re using the app. Since calls are so spammable in DMs or Group DMs, the call screen will appear on your phone and disappear rapidly. While on the calling screen, you cannot do anything other than accept or decline the call. This is an issue because that basically makes it so if someone spam calls you, you can’t do anything until they stop. If you go to block them, it will take much too long. Other than this issue, the developers are pretty good about fixing bugs within the app. Also, if I’m listening to music when I join a call and then leave, my music will have messed up audio after.",4,3.0.4,AGuyWhoWantsInstructions,1
us,United States,8770533075,2022-06-13T10:11:16-07:00,Why?,"When I joined discord in October, I never had put my email in for many reasons. So I thought putting it had no problem at all. And there was no problem till yesterday. Yesterday I was on discord like usual for a while then I decided to close the app for a few seconds. When I reopened the app there was a non exit page that said “add email” . I did indeed hesitantly add my email, then went to my computer to open my mail to confirm that it was me, When I went to open the app my rooms WiFi was slow. So I’m getting inpatient right? So I don’t do the email confirm after all. So I go back to discord. The only options it had In the top right of my screen was “log out” and “Add email” so I decide to log out, delete the app and then reinstall the app again. As I do that I log in with my original account and it goes for the same force my email page. So once again I log out and and try to register with my original info of my account. And so it worked but I had no idea that when I was still at log in and it asked to reset my password, so I put the SAME password for my original account and thought I solved it all but when I entered the information on the register page it asked me to fill out what people want to call me and all that starter stuff. At that point I new I made a new account without knowing. So I log in and I’m in the new account with the same information as my original account! Of course I log out and go to the log In page to log into my original information and it sends me to the new account i accidentally made. Now I can’t log into my original account. I’m not very happy what discord did with that force to put my email in. Maybe I should have probably wait a few days till it went away but like I said I was inpatient and nervous onto what’s going to happen. So please help me with a solution to get my ORIGINAL account back. I am not very happy.",2,130.0,Armeen <3,0
us,United States,10158229723,2023-07-19T09:15:19-07:00,My review on discord by Kenny,"This app is awesome so many things to enjoy and many people to meet. Quite a number of communities use discord as a means of communication and organization so it’s not hard to find to find a server where you fit in. And without a doubt you can see why many people use this app it has easy to use menus as well as not having to spend any money to have fun, anything you spend is purely cosmetic unless it’s something in a server. Finally with the ability to connect so many different accounts to your discord account it really is a great way to round up all your socials giving many people the opportunity to talk to you more freely, but if you don’t want that? They have an option where you can only get texts from your friends who you choose. Overall a great app I highly recommend this to anyone who has the patience to read this thank you to the reader and discord thx
                                                                                            -Kenneth James",4,186.0,mann goodman,0
us,United States,14176465757,2026-06-12T21:25:49-07:00,Ten bucks is my LIFES worth,"So im a constant user of discord, and anyone whos generally familiar with the app would know of a perk system that the app has which is ‘nitro’. Recently, they came out with another perk system that that lasts up to three days which is obtained through watching adds, in exchange of currency that can be added up to obtain said perks which is called ‘orbs’. Basically, while having my orbs enabled (which is nitro for ‘free’) my friend gifted me nitro. Now keep in mind i hadn’t touched the gift while my orbs were enabled because i didnt want it to cancel out and have me not get it. When i went to go and get the nitro that my friend had so generously gifted me, wumpus in all his greatness waddles in and tells me that ive already claimed this nitro (plot twist: I DIDNT) and apparently theres no way for my friend to resend the link so i can finally receive my nitro. Ive searched the web, ive looked into my account credit, guess what? NOTHING. Discord, your app had essentially ROBBED my friend of ten bucks (which is way too overpriced btw) and now im left with no nitro and shes left with ten dollars, ten MEALS, RIPPED from her hands. ZERO STARS. Please fix your app because this is absolutely infuriating,ty for reading!! xx",1,332.2,16yo girl who was robbed,0
us,United States,11015618105,2024-03-06T11:37:11-07:00,Bad updates,"Update: March 2024. 
Yet another update made it even worse. Video calls on mobile are now upside down or sideways… we didn’t have this problem before. If I could give 0 stars I would.

The previous version had a few issues like switching apps while in a video call would cause the other persons camera to have an “unstable internet connection” message. The new updated UI for video calls is worse. Instead of having the other person full screen, both you and the participant appear in smaller boxes half the size of the screen. If you want to maximize the video, the button is sometimes underneath other UI elements so you can’t press it unless you rotate your phone. On top of that then you full screen, there are smaller windows that appear with you and the other person as well as yet another window of just you. It’s a cluttered complete mess. Discord’s official response of “we understand you’ll need time to adjust” is disrespectful. Despite all the issues and feedback on the site, they’re ignoring their user base. Really sad to see. The mobile app in its current state (Dec 2023) isn’t worth the time or nitro subscription.",1,218.0,Semiazan,1
us,United States,10921535769,2024-02-09T17:30:21-07:00,The new ui blows,"I would’ve given this app 4 stars because it’s very convenient to chat with friends and message them in discord servers. But the new mobile Ui has really messed things up. The flow of things is really sluggish and hard to navigate. I would’ve liked the option to switch back but as the time of this review it is not available. If you just using discord for the first time on mobile, it may not seem as bad, but especially if you used the old UI design for Discord for the mobile version it’s really jarring. For now this app gets 2 stars. Haven’t even mentioned the Discord nitro paywall. I get it you need to make money off of the app without ads so this is obviously a good idea but the limitation it brings for the free version is really a lot. The main problem is the customization options are locked behind it. and overall not using Discord nitro make your experience worse. Isn’t as bad as I’ve seen in other apps, but it’s still pretty much. I’ll be using Discord on my computer a lot more. Sorry if this review is a bit messy and out of order. I just really needed a way to discuss this.",2,215.0,Mr. Trey06,0
us,United States,10921182705,2024-02-09T14:58:20-07:00,New Update,"My phone forced me to get the new update recently and honestly I’m finally getting all the complications I’ve heard about from my friends about it. The UI is getting worse and worse, not being able to swipe to see my dms is actually awful. I could go on and on about my complaints here but that’s not actually what I wanted to say. 

I took a look at all the recent reviews to see what’s been going on in other user’s minds during this and honestly are y’all even reading them? The majority of the devs replies to the reviews have nothing to do with the actual review itself. The fact that the UI is becoming worse and worse isn’t something to rectify with “Check our article explaining the update!”, we know how it works. That doesn’t belay the fact that it’s upsetting. We don’t want to know how it works, we want to express the fact that older features of discord are just better than the new. Honestly just make an option in the app and give users the option to configure the new features or something, would solve all your problems. I’m not looking for a reply, I’d just like for this to be read by an actual human being please.",1,215.0,Quinnn027,2
us,United States,9153948953,2022-10-05T07:38:01-07:00,Rotation of the screen,"Ive had discord for so long that I have it on both pc and phone, I have 0 problems with PC as its very easy to use and overall does what it should. But the thing is with the phone some people have big hands and like to text sideways of things like that, for me though, I have big hands that I like to have my phone sideways so the buttons to type are easier to press and I have less of a problem. Discord however, does not allow this on phone, I have no idea why but it doesn't work. It did start doing that recently but like 2 minutes after it stopped. I was hoping that they would understand this about discord and make it rotatable. If you have a problem and discord rotates itself, just turn lock screen on, its not that hard to turn on and off and it helps a lot. I just hope someone at the discord company sees this and fixes anything with discord being sideways instead of the default rotation, its getting annoying with how many typos i've made.",4,147.0,ComputerBros,0
us,United States,4472081642,2019-07-16T17:10:50-07:00,Email changing problem,"Hey, so. I started to use this app so i could communicate with others, especially yters who have discord servers. As a mistake, I misspelled my email by one letter, so i went to change it because I needed to verify it to be able to message in some servers ,and since the email is incorrect, it wouldn’t send the message to my gmail/mail for verification. As I went to correct my email and hit save, it would give me a message. The message simply said something along the lines of, “email has already been registered.” I’m not sure what it meant by this, because i never verified my actual email just yet. Thus, once i hit save it wouldn’t change it. I’m currently stuck with an incorrect email that can’t be verified nor changed to the right one, because it’s misspelled so it wont send. Is there anything I can do to be able to change my email?? Oh, And i’m on mobile too... if that has something to do with it. What exactly does the message “Email already been registered” mean. My email hasn’t been able to be added yet!! And I haven’t given anyone access to it either.",3,3.0.7,🐳🐬🐳🐬🐳🐬,2
us,United States,10817143499,2024-01-13T05:33:00-07:00,Doesn’t work as well as before,"I’ve been using discord since June 2022 and I thought it was amazing. There were no loading problems, you can talk to people through dm, groups, or servers and there’s a lot of fun things to do in the servers. However now when I try to use discord it takes forever to load and won’t let me in the app at all. I’ve tried restarting my phone several times, uninstalled and reinstalled the app several times and nothing has worked. This part has me very disappointed. 
Another thing I’d like to point out is that I’m paying for nitro yet and I don’t think I will for reasons. I saw there were some frames and other stuff you can add to your profile but you have to have nitro and pay almost $5 on top of that. You’re already charging from I think $3-$10 so to me that’s going too far. 
One last thing that I’m having problems is when I add the bots to my server(s) they don’t do what they’re supposed to do(ex: the counting bot will skip from 4 to 6)
I used to love this app but it has honestly disappointed me, will not be using discord again until I can load in it.",2,211.0,Trashygarbage,0
us,United States,9931160707,2023-05-15T18:00:23-07:00,All gone,"This app is a great app for keeping in touch with friends. When Covid started, all my friends got discord, made servers, group chats, called each other, and had so much fun. I made so much online friends, I made friends through mutual friends IRL and some of them are my closest friends today. I’ve used discord to save photos, write important dates, and anything that’s really memorable. However, the TOS is a little unfair. I’ve joined a couple server that were politics related because debates is one of my interests. The discord team cracked down on those servers one day and suddenly my account is gone. Years of memories, important, dms, funny moments, videos, photos, group chats, and a lot others is just gone. I’ve lost so much with my account getting disabled. I’ve reached out and they refused to reinstate my account. If you really love looking back at old messages, writing down important info, or even saving photos through a server, I wouldn’t recommend this app. One day your account could just be gone and everything is just lost. Discord was a great app for me, but I think I’m done using it after what just happened.",2,178.0,drakeVO,0
us,United States,7187398522,2021-04-05T10:35:19-07:00,"Great app, got a suggestion tho :3","Hi! I’m a person who uses discord on mobile, and I feel like there are a lot of features pc and computer users have that mobile users don’t. Great app in everything else though. Not to offend anyone. Just a suggestion if it’s not being done already: could y’all possibly pass on some features from pc and computer to mobile? For example, I’ve heard of something along the lines of streamer mode on a server I’m in that can only be accessed on pc I think, plus there’s the really really dark version of dark mode which idk how the hecc im meant to access that- anyways back to the point, could there be some features from pc that are added to mobile? It would help a bunch because there are so many differences from mobile discord to pc that it feels like mobile is kind of limited with features. Not to be rude to anyone on the discord.. development team? Whatever it’s called, I know y’all are probably hard at work on stuff sorry if I’m bugging ya. :3",5,65.0,iwaswatchingyoutube,0
us,United States,6819265311,2021-01-01T13:00:29-07:00,Bias  Review (sorry! lol),"I met my entire friend group and even my current boyfriend through this app, I have gotten emotional help, and met people with the same problems with me and no longer feel alone with them (I have a pretty rare disorder) 
Needless to say I think this app is one of the best out there to be able to connect to other people through easy to use servers, text etc.  of course I cant promise anything but from someone who was able to find friends after 3 years of being alone, come out and feel safe safe about it (Lgbt) I think some others can find it just as helpful. 
From a person who sprawls in small groups, there really is anything for anyone on discord and its easy to find as long as you know where you're looking. 

Although with my obvious Bias I really do appreciate Discord, if you can stand some changing things about it as discord figures out to make it better, then its worth a shot to download and try out.",5,53.0,Jade_Shula,0
us,United States,7183914069,2021-04-04T12:55:05-07:00,easy to lose a account,so i had a 5 year old account that i had all my friends added on and lost all of it because i upgraded my phone i had two factor authentication on because i was hacked before so i didn’t want it to happen again but when i got my new phone i had all of my data except for my 2FA codes which was okay because there is a way to backup your account without one if you had your phone number linked to the account which i did but they removed the option to do that for whatever reason so i lost a account that i spent 800 dollars on roughly for yearly nitro subscriptions and all of my badges gone to waste now i don’t chat on it a lot i use discord for things like dank memer i love those mini games on servers but i had just lost 5-8 years of progress and then i get banned for saying that i’m on a alt account UNTIL i can get my account back and i made a appeal but it was denied it seriously got denied for absolutely no reason if you’re going to use 2FA make sure to take a screenshot of all the backup codes and write them on paper or something just in case,3,65.0,robloxplayer77,1
us,United States,6427085451,2020-09-13T21:15:04-07:00,Needs a seen/read message feature,"I love Discord a lot, I use it a lot more than my Messages and Phone app on the IPhone, but one thing I really want on Discord is an option where you can see if someone has seen or read your messages. I'm thinking this will only function in group chats and direct messages and not on servers. This would be a good option to have since you will be able to know if someone has been reading your messages or ignoring them. I personally had some problems in the past regarding people ignoring me and I couldn't tell if they were even reading what I was sending them. There are numerous apps with texting that have this feature and I think it would be most helpful if we could toggle the read/seen feature. It would be very helpful for those who want to know if someone read their messages and also it could help to see if someone is just ignoring and can potentially fix up friendships and relationships. 

This is just an idea that I had and I just hope someone responds or takes this into consideration but, please, having a feature to know if someone read your messages in a group chat or dm would be extremely beneficial for others to know who's been actually acknowledging the messages it can also help others find out if there's someone in a group or in a one-on-one friendship that is just ignoring. Having read receipts are very helpful for picking up signs from other people and I think it would be a necessary addition to Discord.

Thank you and I hope my idea will be taken to consideration.

From,

A friendly Discord user",5,38.0,M4Y0~,0
us,United States,10687892627,2023-12-12T17:28:54-07:00,"New and ""Improved"" Discord Mobile Update","While I understand some people might not like the aesthetic and I am one of those people that's not my complaint for this review right now. 
