us,United States,9571484186,2023-02-01T07:01:13-07:00,It’s good but just one issue,"So, while trying to join other servers on discord it will send me here to update this up everyday sometimes, mostly it will just make me open the app but the issue here is that when I try to join someone’s discord server like a game company server or a YouTuber who posted his link to his discord server will lead me to here to update my discord app, when I updated it I will open the app and find that I haven’t joined their discord server it happened to me almost everyday and now I can barely join some community servers that I’m willing to go in and have some fun conversations and meeting new people online. Now I have to make my friends who use computers to have to join their server that I want to join and give me an invite to join the server I wanted to join. It’s kinda easy but now it’s hard to join community servers. But still a good app to have conversations to people and meet new friends to have chat with!",5,163.0,EVbwkamqksmwllemcnz,0
us,United States,13739583908,2026-02-11T18:03:29-07:00,Upcoming changes are unconscionable,"If I was judging the current functionality and experience of the app, it would be around 4 stars. However, the decision to implement a worldwide requirement to either use a face scan or government ID, literally just months after implementing the same thing in one country and having that information immediately get hacked and leaked, when you had promised over and over before the implementation that said verification data would not be stored, is such a head-in-the-sand move that it would be funny if it wasn't so dangerous for so many people and their personal data. And we know that the real reason doesn't have anything to do with protecting children; the real reason is because the company just recently secretly filed for an IPO and wants to look good for shareholders in terms of how much data they have and can collect to sell, train AI models on, and all the things that shareholders love.

The direction of the app and the experience as a user had frankly been declining steadily for several years, especially as paid cosmetic features and Quests were more and more aggressively shoved down the user's throat over time. So the functionality and experience I mentioned above has already declined to be around 4-star worthy, instead of the easy 5 it once used to be. But these decisions made recently have been enough that I have canceled my Nitro and all server boosts after almost 7 years of very loyal patronage, and will be encouraging my friends and others to do the same, then migrate over to some other alternative, even one that may not be as fully featured. The direction of the company and service simply cannot be trusted anymore.

I've rated the app 2 stars for the time being because the functionality is still at a very high level for the time being, but once the changes are fully implemented I will change it to a one star review as deserved.",2,315.0,MasterPpv,0
us,United States,11131972480,2024-04-07T07:45:08-07:00,A complaint,"Hello, I have been experiencing multiple technical issues with my discord, on mobile or phone, I have this one issue where whenever I click my power button it removes me from the call, before this severe update on mobile it did not do this and I have to say I do not enjoy the idea of the app kicking me out from discord when I click my power button, it felt better without that type of function 

2nd, before discord had updated Everytime I would call the phone obviously does a black screen glitch when you call someone, this fix this problem I would always put it on speaker and this would never happen, however I have been experiencing reasonable issues with discord on when I still put it on speaker mode now it does the black screen glitch and that is aggravating I can’t just call and not be able to look through my phone without it glitching or not letting me click anything ,

Overall this new discord update has been extremely annoying and frustrating to all users, I understand you wanted to give your mobile team a new change and that’s okay, but the unnecessary and unneeded things that you’ve added have only made this update an issue and ruined the experience for new users including old users who wish to have stayed with the old discord, if possible there should be a setting between people having the old discord or the new discord so they can switch the settings back and forth to their liking.

Thank you,

Sincerely Erneliz Carranza",3,223.0,hankwimbletondagoat,0
us,United States,6242305665,2020-07-25T19:36:18-07:00,Absolutely love it but..,"Ive been on discord for around 3 years and it is SO fun, i have met so many new friends on there. I absolutely adore it, but there is some problems. It’s not really fun how you can’t use animated emotes or even put gifs as ur profile picture and I get that it’s basically the whole point of the Nitro but that’s another problem I have.. The nitro is 𝙡𝙊𝙊$! That’s a lot for such little things. And a lot of people can’t afford that, so I would lower the price to maybe 50$ or around that area. Also I know there is some way to change it but I have no idea how so this isn’t much of a complaint but I just hate it when I put :) and it goes to 🙂 or :( to 😦just..no sorry-. And my last complaint is videos and pictures.. I can only send 1 second Vids bc it has to be under 8 something I don’t remember but it’s like a limit. I don’t really know how to describe it but it’s kinda annoying. Other than that I love it. 🤍🤍",5,31.0,Carzzzzzzzz,0
us,United States,4441245716,2019-07-10T21:16:39-07:00,Notifications are glitchy,"So, the app overall is really good! And I definitely recommend it as long as you associate with the right people. Most people on discord are rude, mean and just terrible. But there’s a mix of just about everyone on discord and that comes in handy when you’re looking for friends. But, the notifications don’t work for me. And it’s not just me! It’s also my friends on there too, either it be direct messages or even server messages. I’ve went to settings and enabled the notifications many times but no matter what I do they just don’t work. So in the next update I’m hoping to see an improvement on that if it’s possible for, also I’d also like a way to delete the chat and have it deleted for good! Usually when you close a dm the messages stay there, but I’m also hoping for a way to delete it for good. I bet many people are looking for the same things in discord as I am, so please reply to let me know what could and can’t be done?",5,3.0.5,Kay3CR13n,0
us,United States,9218538056,2022-10-24T15:26:27-07:00,Good but can be weird… please read,"So I’m a 16 year old who uses Discord and it’s an awesome app where you can chat, hang out, talk and everything. It’s super fun! But the thing, if your kid or just someone who doesn’t have some sort of screen time with discord, who is younger than 14 or 15 should NOT be using it. As I was using it, I realzied how vulnerable I am to a lot of people. I used to ask people on roblox, or on any other games for their discord but thrn they started acting shady. I always asked them for their age and they always said either 14 or 15. But they didn’t act like a 15 or 14 year old. My friend friended someone and when they called, it was literally an adult. He wasn’t mean or bad, but isn’t It weird? Tk have some GUY call you? But then their avatar is like a kid in roblox? I suggest (parents this is to you) to monitor your kids on this app. My mom uses screen time for this exact reason, who knows what type of people you friended. But if u are gonna fried random people, DONT give them your address, phone number, email, ANYTHING. Lie about your age too. I lied and said I was 18 when I’m. Not. Because who knows what type of random weird people out there. I a
ways friend people who I know and met but even then. Be careful with who you friend. Please be careful kids, I know I seem like an adult or parent saying this but it’s true, trust me. You have to. Pleaseee be careful. 13 or younger should NOT be using this app. 

Thank you, 
And parents reading this, there’s something called Screen time that you can put on your kids device, phone, iPad, and even computer, as long as it’s apple you can. I have to as well. It’s honestly  a lifesaver to me and my friend. And I don’t waste time on my phone or device alot because of it, I either draw, go outside. You must out a password. The kids have to send a request in order to play or do anything. For me, music, messages Is good. But all my apps shut down at 9:00 sharp. Then the next day it starts at 6:40 for school. Parents PLEASE take care of your kids!",5,149.0,its amazing pls consider,0
us,United States,10916483096,2024-02-08T08:19:51-07:00,Fluctuating Feelings,"I love discord. The features are amazing. I do believe that sometimes they make unnecessary changes that nobody asked for. Sometimes they’re for the better often times nobody realizes they were made and could have been left alone. 

Sometimes, like now; a change is made and it fundamentally breaks something in the app. Since about a week ago; the app occasionally freezes up while in a voice chat, and i can’t do anything until (which i found out later) open the voice pop out window and re minimize it, to let me view the whole app again. Just recently i have noticed that occasionally without any warning or prompting the ability to enter text just goes away. I will switch between channels, and then i just can’t type forcing me to close the app fully. 

Just yesterday (2/7) i had started getting randomly kicked and then rejoining voice calls, and i checked for an app update. which fixed the problem for almost 20 hours. please can you resolve these issues? thanks.",3,215.0,Frank-Grouch,0
us,United States,8599424303,2022-04-23T16:41:47-07:00,not bad but not good,"So honestly, discord is a good app for making new friends, socializing, and some other stuff, so then again i bought nitro right, so i bought it then apparently when i got nitro it was working. Then one day i had to delete it because something was wrong, so i deleted it and tried to get it back but it kept saying i have to do this billing payment which i already did and then it said my card info and under it said failed but i used it perfectly fine, i know its not discord and that its my phone because whenever i try to download other apps i deleted it says the same thing, so im confused discord is it my card?, my phone?, or just something else, ofcourse not the app because its about billing but then again i think it is the app because i did use my card on it. so if you read this thank you and i honestly dont know how you can solve this but besides everything, discord is a good app.",5,122.0,eat me out ;),0
us,United States,7218342390,2021-04-13T10:20:20-07:00,Discord new ToS and Server Designation,Right so I’m giving this five stars so folks can see it and hopefully the developers do as well. Discord is great. Love the app. Love using the service. But the new thing they’re implementing. The complete barring of iOS users from NSFW servers? It’s absolutely ridiculous. I don’t understand why users who own their tech can’t do what they want on it. Maybe it’s corporate Puritanism. Maybe it’s Discord implementing a CyA measure. I’m not really sure. But one thing is for sure; it’s absolutely ridiculous that this is happening. If someone can get back to me on this I’d much appreciate it. Be it Apple or Discord. And to my fellow users. I call on you to come to arms over this. Those of us who are 18+ should not be barred from the content we want to see on the apps we installed on technology we have bought. Same thing with right to repair but that’s another battle for another day. Right now this is the battle we should be fighting.,5,67.0,deadlyDragons,0
us,United States,7211871622,2021-04-11T15:38:04-07:00,This app is great but could use more features..,"I think the app is great overall but it could use some more features that would better improve the app's overall quality.
First of all, it would be great to have a feature that introduces multi-member selection! I think this feature would be useful in servers when you need to ban or kick multiple people at once, or in the friends list when you wanna clear out those inactive people. 
In addition to that, I think file upload support for audio, zip or other file uploads that aren't videos or photos would be amazing! Just think of all the possibilities that could be imaginable, from sharing a texture pack with your friends or showing your server members that new song you've been developing on that music app you bought. 
But, Discord is still great overall even without these features because you can talk to friends from long distances.",5,67.0,Calimar28,0
us,United States,4077256635,2019-04-29T09:19:49-07:00,Accessibility is Sorely Lacking,"Discord has the potential to be a wonderful and inclusive networking tool for everyone, but unfortunately they have been ignoring a large part of their potential user base by not implementing basic accessibility measures. They are neglecting basic application decency that their competitors have already stepped up with. Discord has been saying for many years that they care about screen reader accessibility, for example, but they have done next to nothing to make sure that blind people using these softwares are able to effectively join their conmunities like anyone else would. I'm sure it's a great program, so I hear from my friends using it, but until they catch up with the times and make it so I can navigate with VoiceOver at least, only two stars here.

Regarding your response:
I don't think your team understands that you're asking us to submit feedback for an unusable system on that very system. Many people can't access that server, and the few blind folks who told me they could said it was by luck or coincidence.
You're telling us we can have a key to the house, but it's currently locked inside.",2,3.0.0,BlindAsAZubat,4
us,United States,3021307398,2018-08-05T07:38:09-07:00,Keyboard really buggy with new update,"The discord app had worked almost seamlessly in the past in the two years that I had used it, but with the new updates (the ones that coincided with the ""new fresh look"" of the message bar), the keyboard has been having very suboptimal performance, to the point where it interferes with my ability to use it so much that I decided to write a review to make this problem known. I've never had issues such as this one in other iOS apps. 

What happens is that I will sometimes type a message and it will jump to the middle of an already typed word and type in the middle of that. At other times, autocorrect will refuse to work, and when I type on messages to edit them, they will be fixed in the message bar but will send with the original typo. Sometimes, I have sent a message, and while it does send, the whole message will still remain in the message bar where I had typed it, making me clear it manually. 

Overall, my discord experience has been good across all platforms, but I do hope a fix for this is issued soon.",3,2.3.5,Chubbi Pandaa,0
us,United States,10687633546,2023-12-12T15:52:28-07:00,New UI ruins user experience,"Ever since they forced the terrible UI onto all mobile users I cannot navigate through the app without constantly making mistakes and wasting several minutes of my time to check or send 1 message. Because of the desktop app, and the old (much better) UI mirroring it, I use the active users in a server to often send direct messages to people. When I try to access the active users I always end up accidentally starting a reply to a random message in the channel. This would ordinarily bring up the active users instead, which would make sense because the active users in channel show on the right side of the channel in the desktop app. Nothing in this new UI makes sense; it seems like it’s a separate app with cross play included at this point. Please discord… please revert. If this isn’t fixed in the near future I might just uninstall discord mobile altogether… who needs a mobile version? I can always just text my friends and they’ll receive images in better quality, and I won’t even have to pay for nitro if I’m just using voice chatting when I’m playing games with friends at home.",1,208.0,JunHe3,0
us,United States,10397536805,2023-09-22T23:56:24-07:00,so. many. bugs.,"There is way too many bugs for mobile and everybody knows this. I reached out to support about them and they simply said it didn’t happen for them but numerous users (not just me) have reported the same thing. 

When we swipe to see the channels, the channels fills the entire screen and we cannot swipe back into the channel. This is a prevalent bug and when I emailed support about it, they gave me the most basic solutions and then proceeded to say that it was not occurring for them when it seems to be affecting more and more users. This email occurrence was 2 weeks ago and I waited to see if maybe an update would fix it or if Discord would notice it but nothing happened.

Another bug is I cannot swipe to see the members in the channel anymore. Nothing I’ve tried works for any of these bugs. I’ve tried restarting my phone, turning off low power mode, reinstalling, hard rebooting my phone— nothing is fixing it. Please Discord, focus time on fixing the mobile app instead of silly features like new app icons. They’re lovely, but please fix the app. One star review so it actually catches their attention.",1,196.0,Pawify,1
us,United States,8438522628,2022-03-09T16:10:58-07:00,updates aren’t useful as my bugs are still happening,"Been using for almost 3 years and never rlly had an issue. Although it took me a few weeks to understand how to use discord bcus of how complicated it is to use. Its pretty fun, but I do wish they had a feature where you can browse to join a server on the app. It’d be so much easier to find things I enjoy. My main issue about why I didn’t give a five star is bcus I realized that whenever I watch a video sent into     a server, it lags and pauses by itself, it does it over, and over again. It kept doing it so I went to look and see if it needed an update. It did. So I updated it and it was still doing the same thing. Also when I play a video it says it’s playing, but its not and I have to reload the video multiple times. They seem to do nothing about that since that bug has happened to me for many months. I’ve checked my wifi and data but it all works perfectly fine. I hope the workers of discord can fix this problem as it really bugs me.",3,117.1,astroyz,0
us,United States,13740507478,2026-02-12T01:29:09-07:00,🎵Let the games Begin~🎶,"You know… it’s rather cute that you think all of this will just simply go away. That we’re just dumb incompetent sheeple that will do whatever you and various other corporations in business suits say; But you’re DEAD WRONG. Our voices will never be silenced and by having this review at 5 stars to get everyone’s attention about this issue won’t blindside our voices, OUR PRIVACY. So BUCKLE UP BUTTERCUP, You got on this ride and you ain’t getting off any time soon. See you in court with that lawsuit from various gamers and parents complaining about THEIR KIDS Biometrics ID and Face ID.

