us,United States,10706328836,2023-12-16T22:45:06-07:00,Version 208.1,"This version is an absolute embarrassment to this once great platform. Mobile version is no longer useable. I used to only use the mobile version to connect with distant friend groups and others. This newest version stripped the mobile app of many features in the idea of “if we dumb down our app, it opens us up to the masses.” They have consistently made the mobile application worse and worse through repeated updates that nobody has asked for. I will no longer use the mobile version and have transitioned to the pc version. The original version in which the mobile was fashioned after.

I feel terrible for the developers who think they improved the app to only realize that they butchered the only good thing about it. They have consistently made developments which have degraded the user experience to the point in which they are driving users away from the platform. In the history of updates this will go down as one of the worst. Unfortunately it brings into question whether users should continue to support the development process via nitro subscriptions.",1,208.1,Rushthebase,0
us,United States,10686300677,2023-12-12T08:18:31-07:00,redesign is an accessibility issue,"the new discord update is poorly designed, unintuitive, and bad for accessibility. too many menus to click into for basic functions makes it difficult for users with hand pain while useless functions are prioritized (for example, needing to scroll sideways in my DM tab to see all the online users... ever??? how is that navigable?) it was easy to use before when servers and DMs were under one server list instead of having to navigate through separate menus. there's never a time in which i think ""wow i'd love a separate menu to click into to find my basic use functions."" i treat my DMs like servers and want them in the same location not to mention it lags extremely badly and the contrast is now very difficult to read especially on the in-app notifications which do not pass a web contrast checker. the new dark theme is also more difficult to read it's disappointing that many people have said this in testing and they rolled it out anyways the appeal of discord is that it's not like other apps. this is why i use it. very disappointing and not usable for me",1,208.0,cee de,5
us,United States,9648609895,2023-02-23T16:25:04-07:00,"App is great, but a few concerns","(1st Concern) I’ve had discord for almost a year now and it’s great but a problem for me has been discord glitching and suddenly freezing, and no it’s not my phone, the app just freezes, and yes you might think this occurs just a few times, but no, it always happens when I’m changing my profile picture, or looking at someone elses profile. The only way to stop it is to close the app and open it again which I find annoying. 

2. Concern is that my keyboard keeps covering the parts in my bio that I wanna fix and I’m sure that it’s not just my phone because the past months before have never been like this, discord has always been easy to use but now it’s getting annoying.

