us,United States,9079138354,2022-09-12T17:59:51-07:00,A request to add something,"I’ve used discord for like idk 3 years and I completely love it, that’s where I mainly chat with all my friends most of the time. It’s a very great talking app and I’ve gotten 3 of my online friends discord name and we always chat on there. There very nice people, we love calling a lot too, but I just have a little small request: so I was thinking if maybe you guys can add like something where you can add to your story on discord like if it was instagram,snapchat or TikTok. Yk how you can add a quick story to your profile? Yes something like that so that maybe some of your online friends can see what your doing or where your at, they can see mountains water and yk stuff like that. (Yes ik my paragraph sort of doesn’t make sense but please tell me you understand what I’m trying to say) and if so you do add a little feature like that, thank you so much! I really appreciate it.",5,143.0,jose🙇‍♂️,0
us,United States,11980183945,2024-11-22T14:04:14-07:00,I thought my experience mattered…,"No surprise that a big business and its workers could care less. I was banned for someone who also use my account accidentally interacting with an attachment that broke the term service. I was only told the offense, which I understood but, despite asking for a reason to help me understand full reason of my ban, was never explained why Discord sent three punishments instead of one for the single offense. I did ask through email again, but used more broken english since it not the language I completely grew up around. I don’t think thats why Discord couldn’t help me since as far as I know they completely ignored this email. I know the person who originally sent the attachment that got me banned. He told me he wasn’t banned. The only two difference between his account and mine are one he pays Discord nitro (which shouldn’t give him protection from safety violation rules) and two (and I didn’t wanna go down this route but the more I “interact” with the people at discord the more this is looking true) is that by talking with me you could tell I’m latino. I didn’t want to think that they were just chasing money or being racist (if that’s the right word) but after my experience with their “support” team I now believe other. I admit I made two alternate account because Discord wasn’t responding to me. Surprise though that discord cares enough to put time into hunt these accounts down for the so called “ban evasion” they never gave a real explanation for but they are too lazy to give me a bit of clarity on situation like this. Reading other reviews I see other people having the problems where they get banned because Discord doesn’t like them. Another thing that angers me is the fact that discord is still sending me advertizements for Nitro. Is my account ban or not? Not like I can check since I keep getting ignored.",1,255.0,Froglodyte,0
