us,United States,11840756788,2024-10-16T08:57:05-07:00,Constantly logged out,"Discord's new updates have ready been bugging me for these past couple of days. Sometimes it will randomly log me out of my accounts which is super weird to me. The other day when I was logging in to an older account of mine to deactivate it, it forced me to add a phone number to the account. All I wanted to do was deactivate it.
