us,United States,8961530747,2022-08-09T09:06:52-07:00,A leading app in the new art revoltion,"Using artificial Intelligence to create images by txt prompts is one of, if not the most significant bar raising evolutionary change in art creation for humans since we first started doing cave drawings. I would argue more significant then the introduction of digital image editing, for example Photoshop. It is a very different process then using these past digital tools, and with the empowering of the collaborative assistance of AI, happy accidental masterpieces are common. While creating something specific is not always easy, with use like all tools, comes a certain level of mastery. MidJourney, is evolving. The results you can get with it are amazing. Does it have the most features or options? ,….No. can it be frustrating? Yes Especially as your artwork gets lost in the on going scrolling of others generating their own artwork in the chat with the AI system.",5,138.0,EricFro,0
