us,United States,7604081984,2021-07-21T22:44:13-07:00,Newest Update is Terrible. FIX THIS PLEASE!,"I always change my icon on mobile since I like to keep all my pfp images in one place on my iOS photos app, since I find it easier to navigate than Windows Explorer. However, since the last update, changing my icon on the mobile app has been made impossible, due to an issue where NO MATTER WHAT THE QUALITY OF THE PHOTO IS, it will end up blurry and pixelated when you save it as your Discord icon. This has been like this for DAYS, and the fact it has been almost a week or longer with no fix is absolutely abysmal. This should be a top priority issue, seeing as icons are the one thing every one will see when they open a server or channel and look at the active users in chat or at the user list. I’m in no place to judge when it comes to how much time it takes to fix a glitch like this, seeing as I’m not a programmer, but seriously? An icon bug pops up and you don’t make it the top item on your list to fix immediately? As a long time Discord user and fan, this is extremely frustrating and disappointing. Fix this bug. Please.",1,83.0,Wolfkinzz,0
us,United States,6699616177,2020-11-29T09:32:35-07:00,The only social app I enjoy,"The interface is clean, simple, and functional. but with the latest update, I have begun to dislike the direction it is going in.

The new text box is counter intuitive. It doesn't match the rectangular, in-line design format that the rest of the UI maintains. The gift icon has no reason to be right next to the image browser on mobile- why is it there? Buttons that are placed right next to each other should be related. I don't want to spend money on gifts NEARLY as often as I want to send a picture or an emoji in the chat.... it doesn't make sense. It makes it feel like a mobile game where there are ways to spend money around every corner. 

I beg of y'all not to start making everything round. EVERY other social app is round and soft and busy and all too friendly. Discord was just right- the simplicity of the design prioritized text-based conversations over anything else, which allowed for conversations to be easy to read, functional, and easy. Instagram and Twitter are dizzying apps with way too many features, and engagement/content is prioritized over conversation- that approach is far from what Discord's approach is, so it makes sense to me that y'all would avoid that visual language. 

pleeeease restore the prior, rectangular, text box interface. Finally, replies are convoluted. Replies feel clunky because they take up more vertical space... something to consider.",4,49.0,i hate! it here,0
us,United States,4360782519,2019-06-23T16:29:10-07:00,Crashes,"Alright, I’ve been using this app for years. It’s improved in so many ways. While I fixed the following problem by reinstalling, this should not have been a problem in the first place: it kept crashing. To specify, I was on an announcements channel in a server and every single time I would open the app it would crash, kicking me off. Simple solution, but I’m surprised it can still happen even with all of this progress? Lastly, the UI update for DMs. I keep accidentally calling my friends and notifying them when I’m trying to go find something that was longer ago using the search function, realizing it isn’t there anymore. Can you at least add a notification that you are about to enter a call with someone before it puts you into the call, or revert it? Because that’s the other thing that’s been annoying me. Thank you for reading the review, if there is anywhere I should forward this to, please don’t hesitate to ask.",4,3.0.4,Phantuem,0
us,United States,12620797613,2025-05-04T19:58:56-07:00,"I LOVE , but..","so like the title says , I love this app and I made a lot of new friends on it too. it really showed me how to have fun and gave me better online skills and everything. However I got logged out of my account twice , this was because of the security check thingy. I had already confirmed my email and phone number , everything , and then when it gives me the checks it says it’s either already registered , invalid , or it just doesn’t work. For this reason I was logged out of my accounts twice and this is the third time this week that I’ve had to make another account and yet still got logged out and am not able to login after overusing my phone number and email. Another small complaint is that Discord only ever saves your account user and password and not your email nor password used to log into it. These are my reasons for rating it a 4 stars.",4,277.0,yscgs,1
us,United States,11566426873,2024-08-02T23:56:50-07:00,needs work,"i’ve been using discord since about 2018, and it’s treated me well. however recently i’ve ran into a bug where you can save as many pictures as you like from a message, however, they’ll only appear as the first image from that message. it’s really irritating and frustrating, i’ve done everything in my power in order to try and aid this, including restarting my phone, deleting and redownloading, etc. none of these have worked, and i’d like to see it fixed sometime soon. i also notice there’s been a LARGE influx of paywalls integrated into it, and it’s sort of disheartening. the additions of profile themes are often overwhelming to view when looking at someone’s profile, and it would be helpful if there was some way to disable seeing it on other’s profiles. these are just some critiques i have! otherwise, i feel it runs rather smoothly with the occasional freeze or whatever. those never bother me too much.",3,240.0,skaankhunt42,0
us,United States,11538889298,2024-07-26T17:23:50-07:00,Can I have my account back?- I simply just wanted to join my favorite streamers server,"I decided to get back onto discord after a long time because i wanted to join my favorite streamers server. First I deleted my old account cause i kind of forgot that my phone number was with that account, so I go back to register and try to make a new account, I make a new one but then I didn’t do where to verify my email and after some attempts when it wouldn’t let me, I made another account when I finally found out that I had to go on email to verify it (my mistake). So when I did verify it, I went back onto discord and it kicked me out. And when I went back on email it said that I did something to violate the rules or something and it disabled my account and I’ve tried to make other accounts but it doesn’t let me. but I haven’t done anything because I just made that account and haven’t even been on it..and I was just wondering if I could have it back.",3,238.0,daniellaaa🩶,0
us,United States,7334866539,2021-05-13T13:13:29-07:00,"It’s a great app, but the appearance should be customizable in some ways.","It’s a great app, what can I say. The devs are always working hard when the community finds a glitch or bug that would make it less appealing, there are servers for literally anything, and it’s simple to use. But I just have one problem. The new look. I think the dev team should greatly consider implementing an update where you could customize say the color of the new read messages and stuff like that. It’s a simple update, really, but there are probably many other people who would want some sort of appearance customizer. Other then that, it’s the best social app there is. Obviously I will not give it anything below a 5 for something as small as customizing the appearance, but it would be greatly appreciated if you considered implementing my idea. Thank you for this wonderful app!",5,73.0,jruhfnfie8848,0
us,United States,10706610374,2023-12-17T00:25:30-07:00,Squash and stretch bugs and more,"After the Discord UI update came out, it was fine and i didnt mind. I got used to how dms are now in its own category now but week after i noticed why people dont like this update. The window for calls get squished down to the right corner of the screen half the time, sending messages will spam about 5 times or so and i hit send one time. The preview window for watching someone share screen gets doubled when watching, the main screen is shown when tapped in and there is a pop out window while watching covering the screen. And even when still watching another pop up window shows covering more the screen. And when in calls the audio changes from dual speakers to the phone speaker on the top screen only. This whole update felt rushed and did not have any quality control to it at all what so ever. This review will change once there are changes done. I don't care how the whole look of this update goes, just make this dang app functional working again.",2,208.1,G A C.21,0
us,United States,10699144387,2023-12-15T16:32:29-07:00,change the layout back to what it was and ill change my review to 5 stars.,"seriously the new layout is so unintuitive and not at all user friendly. i cant even find how to see SERVER MEMBERS anymore and discords whole thing is socializing! literally every single person who ive heard talk about the new layout change has absolutely hated it. nobody asked for this. its not an update it is an absolute downgrade and nearly unusable because of how much i hate it not to mention how buggy its been (as im writing this i cant access several servers im in bc of a ""temporary outage""). at the very least the new layout should be opt-in or be able to be disabled via settings. im about to downgrade the app to a previous version just so i dont have to look at that god awful ui. if this goes on much longer i will be getting rid of my nitro sub. if its reverted or given the option to be turned off ill change this review to 5 stars. this layout change is very frustrating because i like discord and there is no equivalent app to switch to that i know of, change it back for the love of god!!",1,208.1,klyntarix,1
us,United States,10537876532,2023-11-01T03:21:51-07:00,New Update,"Newest IOS update is terrible. The new layout is nauseating to navigate, even after a week of use. Also feels like features are tucked away into far away corners you have to reach for. Want to lower your mic sensitivity/volume? Well gone are the days of simply swiping up in your call and easily controlling it instantly, now you have to dig around in your settings before you can adjust those. Watching a stream and the audio is too loud or quiet? Well you can’t just swipe up and adjust the stream settings anymore, thats just too convenient, now you have to dig around in your settings again to touch that, because that makes sense. The whole overhaul of the layout is a joke, don’t understand why y’all feel a need to change the existing layout at all, but this is not the way to do it. Whoever designed this new layout, should be laid off, they’re literally just making an inferior layout in every shape and form, i’m shocked this isn’t an april fools joke, the new layout is seriously that terrible.",2,202,anxkelxl,0
us,United States,10410455481,2023-09-26T14:58:00-07:00,Great! But just one thing..,"Ok this may be our WiFi or not but.. everytime we enter the app, it takes forEVER just to load in. And we don’t think it’s our WiFi because we always have good WiFi and cellular data for every other app, but it’s just this one that is acting up. This has been going on for a while, and we wanted to reach out about this to see if it’s maybe a glitch or a bug? We don’t really know. But over all, this is a great app to connect with friends and or family, and we have met lovely people on here! If you really want to find people like you on this app, then your in luck! Because this app has everything you could possibly dream of! (Well, kind of. But you get the point!) This app has earned our respect and we will continue to use it! :)

Oh also, the reason we used words like we/our, is because we are a system! Just wanted to say that so nobody get’s confused! ^^",4,196.0,The Chaotic Collective,0
us,United States,8481246733,2022-03-21T16:01:32-07:00,Discord Is Good But…,"I’ve been using Discord for a year now, and I’ve noticed some problems with both PC and mobile.
Currently, I use my computer for Discord and had no issues for a month. But I did run into a slight problem. I was playing a game until I accidently pressed on a key that activated something weird to happen. My Discord app kept popping up during the middle of me playing my game. I tried my best to solve it but it didn’t work. I tried searching up how I could resolve this, but nothing has worked. Speaking of that, re-downloading the Discord app was really troublesome for me. A message saying “Error” kept showing up. At this point, I was really frustrated and decided to restart my whole computer just because of that.
