us,United States,12859265540,2025-07-06T06:18:41-07:00,would honestly give zero if i could,"this app is actually quite ridiculous. my account was termed a year ago for the message, “turning 12 in 13 days” (i didn’t even say in the message that *I* was turning 12 in 13 days. i was talking about my dog. my account was then suspended until 2026 (even though they deleted it at 1:30 am this morning when i had an OPEN TICKET of me showing my ID as proof of my age on the account). the only form of communication with discord that i’ve had is with their twitter account, which cannot discuss personal account details. in what world is that sufficient? ive also had the ticket open for around a month with no type of reply. can i also mention that for some reason discord allows pedophiles, racists, and homophobes on their app (as it’s almost impossible to get someone suspended for saying that type of stuff)- but if you even elude that you’re under 13 you’re automatically suspended (in less than an HOUR from the initial ‘incriminating’ message?) and it’s almost impossible to get your account recovered? come on, now.",1,286.0,IceddLatte,1
us,United States,12283400525,2025-02-07T14:04:54-07:00,A long and honest review,"Wanna know my favorite part about Discord?
It’s the people I get to meet.
There’s all kinds of people out there, all you have to do is join the right server and you can find your best friends for life. It’s amazing. So if you’re ever looking for an app to find some people who you really get along with, try Discord. I’m being serious. I’d been in a sorta bad mental state for a few years. Felt like everyone pretty much hated me. Then I got discord and it felt like I belonged. I’m ok now, I can smile without forcing it. The whole reason I’m so much more social now than I have been is because of how much discord has helped my mental health. I wish I could put to words how much happier I’ve been lately, but I can’t. This is an honest recommendation here. I can’t make this up, honestly. If you want to try discord, then I definitely say go for it.",5,265.0,bebemyblanket,0
