us,United States,10700517475,2023-12-15T21:33:53-07:00,Updates ruined a good thing,"Love the new dark mode, but now you can’t go a few days without Nitro being shoved at you one way or another. Direct messages and servers are separated star-crossed lovers who miss each other badly. The search function for DMs has gone into hiding. I peel the curtains back to find it cringing beside a friend’s profile. Have we hurt you so badly, that you need to look here for safety? There is clutter, there are ads, invasive AI stop to eavesdrop on your conversations.  I switch between servers, write out a message, switch again.  The screen is frozen.  Nothing loads.  I tap, tap, tap on the buttons, but they may as well be stoned.  This happens every so often.  I can try turning it off and back on again.  Surely I don’t expect any better?  And yet… I am haunted by the Discord that once was.  Where is the simple, clean layout we were lured by?  The fast, smooth model that did not crash every so often?  It is a distant memory, receding into a horizon we cannot see past all the Nitro promotions in our faces.",2,208.1,Angio de Fleur,0
us,United States,9839829514,2023-04-19T16:38:23-07:00,Absolutely great… if it had more attention,"Discord is a great company, and have done an amazing job at building a positive and uplifting community. The problem isnt discord itself its the attention they give to the app, or more fitting the attention they dont give. The PC version of discord works great, I’ve personally never had it crash. But with the latest update discord has crashed atleast once every time ive opened the app. I dont know what is causing it and as such i have no idea if its user error, or the app itself. But if its something caused by the app then this is an issue that should have been addressed long before the update released. 
I love discord and will continue to use it to talk with my friends and engage with communities im a part of. I absolutely recommend discord to anyone wanting a way to interact with others. But i hope that in the future discord will work as hard on the app as they do the PC version of discord.",4,174.0,LavThorne,0
us,United States,8820327208,2022-06-28T14:37:37-07:00,Frustrating accessibility issue,"I use voice over and it seems like recent updates have made the app harder to use, specifically while in servers and in channels themselves. The name at the top of the screen is ""unreadable"" as are the options under the channel menu. Most inconvenient is the fact that the options for searching  for a message are all unreadable as well, from the prompts to the auto fill suggestions, making it difficult to use the search function. Usernames are also unreadable while inside a profile. 
additionally, there has been no easy way to fluidly scroll through messages page by page for sometime now. Usually I have to resort to dragging the screen up or down which is a very tedious process with a screen reader, and selecting previous and next messages with the voiceover cursor itself falls short with longer messages. Please fix this.",4,133.0,Marco McTado,0
us,United States,6728735189,2020-12-07T16:07:59-07:00,Discord is amazing! Yet...,"I have been using discord for a while now, it’s been amazing! Whenever me and my best friends are playing among us we can secretly tell each other who killed each other so we can always know how to react. One thing I wish would be different is that when you unfriend someone, their messags and texts, along with yours, should dissapear. I had someone threat me to kill myself and so I unfriended them. This girl was my best friend, so I know she was raging with her life and she takes it out the other way, wrongly. But I unfriended her to give her some time that she needs, alone. Yet, her messages kept bothering her now. I hope if you unfriend someone that their messages go away. I hope this will happen in the furture as an update. I really hope that she’ll be okay. Other then me and my suicidal friend, this app is really amazing. I’m able to chat with anyone I want, and create servers within the media.",4,51.0,loveRobloxgirl50,0
us,United States,5775006363,2020-04-07T02:03:55-07:00,Terrible chat app with only two good features,"This app is probably the worst I’ve used!!! It only has two useful features not found in other chat apps and those don’t charge a subscription fee to upload anything. You can’t upload anything over 8mb with paying a ridiculous subscription fee, can’t upload videos without paying the fee or using an outside video service and only posting the link, emojis are also locked behind the ridiculous paywall. In terms of good features it is only limited to two features not found and I can definitely do without those two minor things and prefer to use much better chat apps like line, fb messenger, wechat, band, and what’s app. Also those are free to use and don’t throttle what you can share without a ridiculous fee!! If I wasn’t forced to use the app for one thing I would have deleted this waste of phone space from the get go!! Ohhh added in ability to call extra people still crap maybe drop you fees to upload anything over the pathetic 8mb and allow use of emojis for free instead of nickel and dining people for every little thing you cheapskates",1,16.0,Choada Boy,4
us,United States,3008026746,2018-08-02T16:05:33-07:00,"If you use this more than for communicating, don’t get it.","Honestly it pisses me off, its been a really long time but they STILL never added the audit log settings on the phone, yet you can use it on PC. I also have so many times where I come to a problem, that when I go to server settings, the “Members” and same goes with “Roles” and most likely probably another option too, but when you press the button the majority of the time it just loads. Loads some more. Keeps loading, and loading and loading. But it just NEVER loads at all, just shows the loading GIF. This also mainly occurs when I’m using my data but still the same thing reoccurs even when connected to my home internet. Don’t get me wrong I love Discord on PC though. If I could I would rate 100 stars for the quality, ideas, community etc.. And they’re not at the least uptight or boring compared to every other out there. In my honest opinion of course, and I would surely doubt that anyone would think Discord is just bad or anything, but on the app we have issues though.",2,2.3.5,Djxixjxjdjjssjjxj,1
us,United States,2343773269,2018-03-24T22:32:24-07:00,App was fine with version 2.2.4,"Whatever changes they were trying to fix with the patches put out by 2.2.5 and 2.2.6 have caused my device to repeatedly drop connection to the server and have my voice sound roboty to my raid group. I have just pulled up the old 2.2.4 version from my time machine and am aboutto put it on my phone to test it out. But fortunately on a second device that I have out right next to me I already know that the recent version are the problem. Why? Because during the entire time of me writing this my older phone that is running 2.2.4 has yet to have its connection the server drop just like what was happening on my shiny brand new iphone X. I have been using my X has my raid mic since I got back in November and everyone has commented on how clear my voice sounds. The only thing that has changed and this is this app. I will update when I put the older version on to the X. 

Discord there is a problem and I would like that you revert whatever changes you were intending to fix because they just don't work for me and for several others that have written reviews on iTunes.",1,2.2.6,Couchpotato2013,2
us,United States,13744268068,2026-02-13T03:28:34-07:00,Age Verification System,"the upcoming verification system aims to “protect the kids” by requiring users to provide ID verification. this however, is just a lazy excuse for mass surveillance and data collection, which discord has already had issues with in the not-so-distant past (data breach 4 months ago). the upcoming update sets a precedent, and quite frankly it is a dystopian one. if this update was actually about child safety then discord would be properly moderating their app, not trying to solve the predator issue with age verification. discord is already struggling to make a profit, and many users are protesting this change by canceling nitro subscriptions. i remember when the first rule of the internet was to never give out your personal information, and i surely wont be giving that information to discord. how does the update prevent predators from entering spaces with children in them? what about the creepy people in non-nsfw servers? how does this stop predators from grooming victims via dms? as it stands, this feels like a very blatant attempt to harvest data that they can then sell to conmen and scammers.",1,315.0,deinosaurrr,0
us,United States,9659220820,2023-02-26T15:34:11-07:00,Doesn’t delete app data,"I hate having to do one star for this but I cannot begin to explain how frustrating this is. When you delete an app, it is supposed to delete all of your data for that app from your device; even though it prompts as if it will do that, unlike other apps, discord refuses to delete your data.

I tested this by deleting the app and reinstalling. My account was still logged in when it was done installing. Ridiculous. Then I tried deleting the app, rebooting the phone, then reinstalling. Same account still logged in as if nothing had happened.

This is unacceptable. When you delete an app, it needs to delete all of its data too. Even if there’s a good reason, it still isn’t doing what it’s supposed to be doing: a clean install. Otherwise really decent app but this aspect is totally broken.",5,166.0,Strung Out,0
us,United States,7618398425,2021-07-25T19:36:01-07:00,Great App! some glitches tho,I LOVE THIS APP OMG!!! ok so this is an amazing app because of how great the accessibility is. It’s super easy to talked to friends and join servers. personally i love making servers i find it very fun to either make a big server so all of your friends can chat and even have movie nights by using the share screen feature. I even made a server for my robotics team which was helpful for recording what we talked about etc. The real issue id like to talk about though is with the recent update for me and some of my friends when you have a new pfp it’s blurry :/ this is a major inconvenience because i love changing my pfp especially in the art community i love drawing my own pfp but when it’s blurry it’s just a big down side to this app so i hope it can be fixed! besides that i am in love with discord and would definitely recommend!,5,83.0,oliverr_,0
us,United States,5682270809,2020-03-19T07:05:07-07:00,"Amazing, but some bugs","I use discord all the time for things like talking to classmates and to work with them for online schooling, however there are some small bugs I would like to be fixed. One, let’s say I’m scrolling through a channel and someone sends a message below. When this happens to me, usually my screen will just teleport to another part of the channel, above or below where I was. This happens quite often to me and I hope it can be fixed. Also, sometimes when I’m scrolling left and right quickly to see members and a channel, sometimes the bar at the bottom can glitch out and show up when I’m in the channel, preventing me from typing. Although this rarely happens, I hope you will fix it. Other than those few bugs, this app is phenomenal and extremely useful and easy to use. :)",5,13.1,Eric Last name not here,1
us,United States,6626123549,2020-11-09T06:39:29-07:00,"Good app, just the calls that make it bad.","Don’t get me wrong, this is an amazing app. I’ve met many new people, and it’s so fun to have it in quarantine and you can still socialize without going anywhere. We also relate a ton, being around the same age most of the time, servers are amazing for finding new friends and when you find the right server it’s such a great experience. The only problem I have with discord is the private calls. Such as calls in groups, or DM’s. When I start a call there it’s fine. But after about 5-10 minutes if I try to mute it has delay, and I press it again but because of the delay it just unmuted me. Even with push to talk this happens, and I don’t know if it’s discord or my phone. I assume it’s discord, because this problem doesn’t happen when I’m in a server’s voice chat. So please fix this, it’s really annoying to deal with but it’s my only real complaint.",4,46.0,Bob1234577,2
us,United States,3909662325,2019-03-21T15:47:21-07:00,Great consumer centric service.,"I’m not big on reviews, but I use discord enough that I felt I could add a novel perspective. 

Discord is a great service to help facilitate the set up of groups. Either near or far. Discord is synonymous with gaming, but it’s a lot more than just a glorified Skype clone that games use to communicate during intense moments. 

Discord is easy to set up, and provides a myriad of tools for the owner to separate people into groups, and provides titles. 

I’ve been lucky to have discord during DnD sessions, wow raid firsts, and over watch clutch moments. 

Discord, while a great service, does have a few negatives worth mentioning. 
First, (and I know this is crazy to complain about.) discord seems to update on what feels like a daily basis. Preventing the consumer from being able to connect, or communicate until finished. It’s basically a non issue, but it’s frequency will start to grate on you after a while. All in all a small issue, and will always pick updates over stagnation   

Point two is related to point one. Due to the frequency of updates it’s a bit more often than normal to have a significant bug interfere with gameplay. I myself experienced a issue in which it was impossible for me to load World of Warcraft at all until it was fixed. 

I know these are small gripes, and understand that in the grand scheme of things they amount to little, but I would be remiss if I didn’t bring them up. 

I really recommend discord, and think any computer that socializes online should have discord installed. It’s a fantastic way to foster community, and I hope to see you online!",5,2.5.0,GordonSan,0
us,United States,12151542407,2025-01-06T04:09:39-07:00,It’s a great app but..,"I’ve had discord since 2022, i’ve never had a problem buying nitro up until a few months ago. It was after i disabled my account and came back after two weeks or so, when i tried to buy nitro again the purchase had went through (i bought it on my phone with a payment attached to my apple account) discord said it had gone through but when i had checked billings on discord desktop the purchase never appeared & i didn’t get my perks . I emailed apple and they said discord would have to refund me although i bought it through an apple phone. I emailed discord telling them my frustration but they could not help me. After i couldn’t get my nitro through my phone i decided to buy it on my macbook but once again the purchase went through but didn’t give me my perks. So discord team i ask you, please fix this bug or whatever it may be . Because I’ve spent over 30$ trying to get my nitro back.",3,260.0,tsmtaysatqtmtsmyyw,0
us,United States,13739819306,2026-02-11T19:45:56-07:00,Do NOT Pay Money!,"Big big big problem. This app is EASILY hackable. Once a hacker steals your account, Discord will NOT help you get your account back. If you have made purchases on your account, these will be lost to you. If your credit card is linked to your account, the hackers will have access to it. Again, Discord will NOT help you with this. - Another problem. Discord now requires face ID or a government ID. If you do not provide one, you will be forced to have a “teen” account.  Not the end of the world, but do you really trust an Israeli company to protect your information?  Also, since you already know how easy it is to hack into people’s accounts, do you really want such personal information out there? - My suggestion is this: Use Discord if you want, but never ever give the app your personal information and never ever give Discord your money. Just use the “teen” account and be cautious about what you post. Do NOT trust this company to protect you. YOU be responsible for making your Discord experience a safe one.",2,315.0,KathyRunkle,0
us,United States,10403329016,2023-09-24T12:17:31-07:00,VERSION 196.0 CAUSES APP TO CRASH OVER NOTHING,"I was mid voice call last week and my app kept crashing as I was going through the app browsing, turns out blocked messages causes the app to crash and I’m not the only one. If there’s a blocked message in the chat room you’re in, it’s gonna make you reboot it. I’ve restarted my phone multiple times, I deleted and reinstalled the app multiple times and even went as far as fully update to iOS 17 from the last update for iOS 16 and the app still kept crashing during these moments. 

Thankfully I’m a mod in a server so I had to delete a message that was in the announcements from someone I blocked and somehow that miraculously fixed it, however sometimes it still does it and I have to quickly press the DM button before it loads the page that crashed your app before you exited out of the app to restart it in order to fix it. Very frustrating I’ve had next to no issues since this update except for when discord was in its infancy in 2016.",2,196.0,Mariokong77,1
us,United States,10714422287,2023-12-18T16:49:33-07:00,New UI and my complaints,"I already filed one complaint but didn't go into much details so here's my problems with this new update. 

1. The search engine is completely ruined. I can't find messages I know are there in servers because it shows up as blank if I type a word as common as the or an oc's name that's used regularly. I hate how you removed the pages feature and how you now have to scroll. I like the tab options but feel like those could have been their own separate things. 

2. The new layout it weird and there was no need for that change at all. It is no longer like the desk top version and now looks like every other social media app. I liked how you could access DMs and Servers in the same area and now you can no longer do that not to mention you took away the friends tab and moved to to about me where it has no business being. 

3. In app notifications, when I talk in servers with or without a bot it shows up as if it's a notification in a different channel or server which is annoying. Please fix that if you don't change anything else. 

4. Messages, I will type out full messages and send them then the message will send but also remain in the little typing bar, causing me to have to delete it and then type a reply then delete that after it is sent and so on and so forth. Please fix that. 

Overall this was a sucky update that didn't need to happen and the only good thing to come out of it was the midnight skin. Please take this review and the 5 million others into account and change it back💕",1,209.0,tinkerbell20018 ^•^,3
