in,India,6813709790,2020-12-31T02:08:01-07:00,Best messaging app I have ever used!,"Discord is truly the best messaging app, I love the fact how you can make gaming/school clubs/servers! Set permissions, create roles, make discord bots, add bots to a server e.t.c. Discord is by far and should be the top messaging application. The only problem is that, I wish creating permissions would be a lot more simple for beginners to learn. I have been using discord for a few years now but I still haven’t been able to set permissions. I have not deducted a star because all the other features of discord combined easily overrules this problem for me. But I still hope in the future there is an easier way to set perms. Overall again, great app! 😁🥰😀",5,53.0,i_kabir,6
in,India,5974985536,2020-05-21T07:44:18-07:00,Amazing and useful app,"This app is really very helpful and useful. There are so many servers u can join and have fun, so many different roles with different colours,and so many bots in servers where they do work and it’s so fun. It’s not just a chatting app like many think. It has so many more features , especially for games, and it’s so nice and fun that you can’t understand how awesome this app is unless you download and check it out. Yes, discord will be a little hard to u understand 2-3 days after u download it, but in a few days you’ll get the hang of it.....I would recommend everyone to download it, especially gamers!!!",5,22.0,ÇÂRBØN,9
