in,India,5743715067,2020-03-31T19:37:21-07:00,Notifications break the app,"I love discord and apart from a few tiny bugs it’s fantastic! The biggest problem for me is that I keep discord running in the background a lot and open through tapping on notifications. However, around the third time I do this, Discord goes weird. The space where the keyboard is (this glitch only happens on my iPhone) becomes empty and takes up half the screen, and whenever I try to send a message it doesn’t work. It’s great that you keep adding new features, but you should fix the old ones too.

