in,India,14525554268,2026-09-08T07:48:20-07:00,"⭐⭐⭐ Discord Does Most Things Well, But Quality Comes at a Cost","Discord is pretty good on PC and honestly does most things it says it will. The voice delay is really low, so talking with friends feels smooth. The upload limit is also pretty reasonable.

But the mobile app can be glitchy sometimes, and the voice quality without Nitro is honestly disappointing. It kinda feels like you have to pay just to get decent voice quality, which I don’t really like. Screen sharing could also be much better.

Server boosts are nice if you want higher-quality voice and 2K screen sharing, but having to spend money to unlock those features is a bit annoying.",3,343.0,TheOnlyGodRobi,0
in,India,11959205146,2024-11-16T21:51:57-07:00,App is getting glitched and bugs issues,"I am writing to express my extreme frustration and disappointment with a critical bug that is currently preventing me from communicating with my girlfriend through Direct Messages (DMs). All of my DM messages are stuck, and none of them are being delivered.
