Discord, please fix this error somehow!!",4,255.0,Hatsune Miku Worshipper,1
gb,United Kingdom,13338484997,2025-10-31T08:59:11-07:00,Consider me annoyed,"I’ve been a long-time Discord user, but my experience over the last few months has been extremely disappointing. A friend’s server was taken down for “violent and graphic content” — something I had absolutely no involvement in — yet my account was automatically placed under a “very limited” status and has stayed that way for over four months.

The message I received states that I broke the rules, which is simply untrue. I submitted an appeal, but it was upheld with a generic, automated response that showed no sign of human review or understanding of the situation.

I completely support enforcing community guidelines, but this system punishes innocent users by association and leaves them with no real path to resolution. The lack of transparency and human oversight is unacceptable for a platform of this scale. I hope Discord takes responsibility and fixes how it handles these cases — it’s deeply discouraging to be treated this way after years of using the service.",1,302.0,railville,0
gb,United Kingdom,10728253455,2023-12-21T12:23:07-07:00,Awful new UI,"I rarely write reviews, but felt I had to in this case.  I would have previously rated the app 5 stars, as it was a great app, but the new UI is simply awful.  Functions and area of the app were easy to find and navigate to and it was easy and intuitive.

