gb,United Kingdom,10668012511,2023-12-07T12:51:01-07:00,Good app destroyed by a really dumb layout change,"What’s with the new layout? I get if discord was improving the app for the better, by for example listening the what the user-base wants, but going around and completely ruining the discord layout in order to literally copy the layout of other apps.

