gb,United Kingdom,10667777122,2023-12-07T11:14:48-07:00,I’m so sick of this stupid app,"It’s was actually good. A nice sleek design different to all other apps I’ve come across. I find it hard when theres too much on the screen so the way you could just swipe made it really enjoyable and accessible. There was a slight learning curve getting used to everything but I’d say it was definitely one of my favourite apps for the interface.

