gb,United Kingdom,8405515474,2022-02-28T05:44:04-07:00,Becoming unusable on iPad,"I’ve been using Discord for years, and around two years on the iPad with a keyboard folio. However in the last week it has become nearly impossible to use and I am debating getting rid of the app.

