1. naming server folders
i put my servers into folders a lot, it really helps find them easier, and makes your app look neater. but i think if we were able to give them names it would be even simpler to find certain servers. my servers all have themes like anime or gaming, so i put them in folders together. if we were able to name them it would be much easier to know which server is minecraft themed and which is anime themed.
how would you be able to edit them? i thought about when you click the server an extra icon comes up, maybe dark pr light grey depending on what mode you use. it would have a little purple pencil in it, and clicking that would let you name the folder and perhaps even give it an icon.

2. more people in a group chat
i know you could just make a server and add as many people as you want, but it becomes annoying having more servers for one chat. i would like the limit to be increased by at least another 10, even though 20 does seem like a lot of people in one chat. i just think it would be easier than making a whole new server and going through all the steps to making it just to have 10+ people in one chat.

3. free banners
since banners are a fairly new addition to discord, everyone would want to customise it. i think they should be free to change, but still a nitro feature to make it an animated one.
on top of profiles, i would like for usernames and server names not to be italic as some people have symbols in their user and with the italic, they do look quite silly.

oh and confirming im not a bot- these are genuine ideas :)",5,88.2,AnimeArtist0,0
