gb,United Kingdom,10836502292,2024-01-18T09:26:39-07:00,Plagued with bugs,"Discord itself is completely fine, on desktop it’s a great experience. But the mobile app not so much. It’s so unbelievably riddled with bugs that I find myself having to restart the app several times a day, it’s actually ridiculous.
Such bugs include:
Notifications not clearing when you read them (restart app or tap X on new messages banner every single time someone sends you one)
The keyboard entirely disappearing (restart app)
The bottom icons letting you swap between messages and servers totally disappearing if you click the name of a channel (e.g to see its pins)
Sometimes it will just send your messages to an entirely different channel than the one you’re focused on, which is extremely annoying and potentially a privacy risk.

Overall discord is fine but the mobile app must be managed by the worst app developers I swear",2,212.0,SethWyd,0
